## `Rc`/`WeakRc` under ASan+LSan: no leaks, no double free.
import std.consortium
import std.spark

rune Cell:
    id as int

weave main into int:
    var c as Cell is with id is 5
    var a as Rc of Cell is calling Rc.new with c
    var b as Rc of Cell is a
    var w as WeakRc of Cell is calling a.downgrade
    if (calling w.is_alive) == false:
        return 1
    calling spark.println with "{calling a.strong_count}"
    return 0
